        "name": "Composition",
        "datatype": "enum",
        "description": "What the board or panel is actually made of. The primary durability and warranty fact in decking, and genuinely different from finish_color or brand: a capped composite and a cellular PVC board of the same colour have different expansion, weight and fire behaviour.\n",
        "canonical_unit": null,
