        "expr": "material_composition not in ('Douglas Fir', 'Cedar') or warranty_terms is null",
        "severity": "warning",
        "message": "A limited warranty was recorded against a solid-lumber board. Composite and PVC lines carry 25-to-50-year warranties and softwood lumber does not, so this usually means a warranty was inherited from a neighbouring composite row.",
